---
title: Saved Searches Sequence Diagram
author: Project Sentinel
---

sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Pro User (Dashboard)
    participant Backend as Sentinel Backend API

    User-->>Backend: Save search filter
    Backend-->>User: Confirm filter saved
    User-->>Backend: Load saved search filter
    Backend-->>User: Return saved filter
    User-->>User: Apply filter and view results
